# Normalize everything to LF on checkout — CRLF breaks `make`, bash scripts and
# the WSL build (this actually happened during development). Batch files are the
# only exception (cmd.exe wants CRLF).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binaries
*.ipa binary
*.png binary
*.icu binary
